      object, no environment, floor, walls, background or props; whole object visible;
      clean coherent mesh, moderate detail, no thin/fragile geometry; appropriate
      proportions, recognizable construction; centered on geometric center, main
      axis on Y; textured, game-ready.


      Object: [OBJECT DESCRIPTION]

      Size
